<!--
    Du lieu demo buoi hoc
    =====================
    Tao 8 buoi da danh gia cho hoc sinh An + 4 buoi cho hoc sinh Binh.
    Tat ca buoi hoc dat status='done' de ket qua duoc tinh vao
    current_accuracy_pct, progress_pct, trend va consecutive.

    Tien do sau khi nap du lieu:

    Hoc sinh An – Ke hoach dang active
      obj_01_01 (Giao tiep, muc tieu=80%, trong so=3):
        Cac buoi: 30/40/50/50/60/60/70/70 %
        do chinh xac hien tai = avg(60,70,70) = 66.7 %  |  tien do ≈ 79 %  |  xu huong = cai thien

      obj_02_01 (Hanh vi - ngoi yen, muc tieu=80%, trong so=2):
        Cac buoi: 30/40/40/50 %
        do chinh xac hien tai = avg(40,40,50) = 43 %  |  tien do ≈ 47 %  |  xu huong = cai thien

      Tien do co trong so muc tieu 01 = (79%×3 + 0%×1) / 4 ≈ 59 %
      Tien do co trong so muc tieu 02 = 47 %
-->
